# Blender autosave backup — 32 MB of pure noise
*.blend1

# ── Third-party source assets — deliberately NOT published ────────────────────
# The Figma file and Blender scene are bakalev's (Bachynskyi) community files, not
# ours (see AGENTS.md §2 and the README credit). They stay on local disk: the repo
# does not need them to build, and republishing someone's complete source files is
# not ours to do. 44 MB of the 56 MB was these three.
#
# Consequence: `tools/export_glb.py` cannot run from a clean checkout — it needs
# 22.blend. The already-exported export/hero.draco.glb IS committed, so the site
# builds and deploys fine without it.
onezero/onezero.fig
onezero/blender/22.blend
onezero/blender/laptop.mp4

# large reference renders of the same third-party artwork (~11 MB)
design-reference/images/
